From d48403dab9dae7b7ecb8ea2a7f0bafc803f22e97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 23:45:03 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] net: xpon: preflight OMCI services and recover failed updates

Validate the desired service set before touching the live classifier.
Release obsolete and changed cookies before applying replacements so
only the final set needs to fit. Reapply unchanged services as well,
since a GPON restart may have cleared their hardware bindings.

Remove attempted replacements before restoring the previous snapshot,
check every rollback result, and retain xarray reservations through the
software commit. Report scheduler exhaustion separately from classifier
exhaustion. Add capacity-limited provider tests for reprovisioning,
rollback, validation, restart replay and removal.
---
